The analysis inspector (AnalysisInspector.tsx and analysis.css) adapts the task row,
tool chip, insight card, context card, recommendation card, selection action and
approval card patterns from Beautiful UI (https://www.beautifului.dev/) to
Sidekick's design tokens.

AssistantElements.tsx adapts ThinkingState.tsx, ContextCards.tsx and the inline
SourceChip from StreamingText.tsx. Demo sequences and simulated streaming are
removed; the components display Sidekick's real job states and cited metrics.
The StreamingText word reveal plays once after the verified answer is ready,
with reduced-motion support. It does not simulate backend generation.
Source: https://github.com/slev12397/beautiful-ui/tree/main/components/primitives

